WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.300
Take off your shoes at the door.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:04.960
Inside, the room is quiet.

3
00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:07.520
At the front of the room is a buddharupa,

4
00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.340
an image of the Buddha.

5
00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:11.320
People come in quietly.

6
00:00:11.370 --> 00:00:14.350
Many of them bow three times before it.

7
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.370
But if the Buddha is not a god, why
do Buddhists bow before his statues?

8
00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:22.190
In this mission, you'll
decode a buddharupa,

9
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:25.380
from the bump on its head
to its long earlobes.

10
00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.480
Then you'll tour viharas,
gompas and temples,

11
00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:31.950
from Thailand to Scotland,
and see how they differ.

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.210
Your mission: explain why
Buddhists bow before a buddharupa.
